@startuml
title v1.0 AI 驱动的知识写作与搜索平台 - 用例图

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "游客" as Guest
actor "注册用户" as User
actor "管理员" as Admin
actor "AI 服务\n(OpenAI 兼容 API)" as AI

rectangle "personal-blog-system\n当前分支：work/v1.0-course-delivery（课程交付分支）" {
  ' 游客用例
  usecase "首次访问着陆页 (/)" as UC_Landing
  usecase "浏览首页 /home\n极简自然语言搜索入口" as UC_Home
  usecase "浏览发现页/文章列表" as UC_Discover
  usecase "阅读已发布文章\n含 AI 阅读助手" as UC_Read
  usecase "按分类/标签/知识合集浏览" as UC_Browse
  usecase "传统关键词搜索" as UC_Search
  usecase "注册账号" as UC_Register
  usecase "登录/退出" as UC_Login

  ' 注册用户用例
  usecase "维护个人资料\nMarkdown 知识主页" as UC_Profile
  usecase "创建和管理知识合集\n(原专栏)" as UC_Column
  usecase "新建/保存草稿/发布文章\n分类标签可手动输入" as UC_Write
  usecase "编辑/删除自己的文章" as UC_EditArticle
  usecase "提交评论（待审核）" as UC_Comment
  usecase "点赞/收藏文章" as UC_LikeFav

  ' 管理员用例
  usecase "后台仪表盘\n全站数据统计" as UC_Dashboard
  usecase "管理用户" as UC_AdminUser
  usecase "管理全站文章\n含 AI 审核状态" as UC_AdminArticle
  usecase "管理分类/标签/知识合集" as UC_AdminTaxonomy
  usecase "审核/隐藏/删除评论" as UC_Moderate
  usecase "查看 AI 配置状态" as UC_AIStatus

  ' AI 辅助用例 (v1.0 扩展)
  usecase "AI 写作助手\n搜资料/大纲/润色/搜索摘要" as UC_AIWriting
  usecase "AI 阅读助手\n文章智能问答分析" as UC_AIReading
  usecase "AI 内容审核\n质量评分/报告/建议" as UC_AIReview
  usecase "AI 智能搜索\n意图理解/扩展/重排/降级" as UC_AISearch
  usecase "记录 AI 调用日志" as UC_AILog
}

' 游客关联
Guest --> UC_Landing
Guest --> UC_Home
Guest --> UC_Discover
Guest --> UC_Read
Guest --> UC_Browse
Guest --> UC_Search
Guest --> UC_Register
Guest --> UC_Login
Guest --> UC_AISearch

' 用户继承游客
User --|> Guest
User --> UC_Profile
User --> UC_Column
User --> UC_Write
User --> UC_EditArticle
User --> UC_Comment
User --> UC_LikeFav
User --> UC_AIWriting
User --> UC_AIReading

' 管理员继承用户
Admin --|> User
Admin --> UC_Dashboard
Admin --> UC_AdminUser
Admin --> UC_AdminArticle
Admin --> UC_AdminTaxonomy
Admin --> UC_Moderate
Admin --> UC_AIStatus
Admin --> UC_AIReview

' AI 辅助关系
UC_AIWriting ..> UC_AILog : 写入日志
UC_AISearch ..> UC_AILog : 写入日志
UC_AIReading ..> UC_AILog : 写入日志
UC_AIReview ..> UC_AILog : 写入日志
AI --> UC_AIWriting
AI --> UC_AISearch
AI --> UC_AIReading
AI --> UC_AIReview

note right of UC_AIWriting
  v1.0 收束为四项核心：
  搜资料(research)、大纲(outline)、
  润色(polish)、搜索摘要(search-summary)。
  真实调用需配置 API Key 后验证。
end note

note bottom
  v1.0 课程交付阶段（分支 work/v1.0-course-delivery）。
  CR-009 产品重新基线化：AI 驱动的知识写作与搜索平台。
  新增 v1.0 能力：首次着陆页、AI 阅读助手、AI 内容审核、
  Markdown 个人主页、分类标签手动输入、文章增强。
  保留 Flask + Jinja2 + SQLAlchemy + SQLite 技术栈。
end note
@enduml
